#!name=Russia RKN Bypass (TSPU) 2026
#!desc=Gets past TSPU / Roskomnadzor in Russia (2026-09-13 edition, from published sources + TCP measurements from 7 Russian networks, not yet verified on mobile on the ground): (1) OTT messaging/calls blocked outright (WhatsApp, Viber, Signal, Discord, FaceTime, Snapchat, Threema) or throttled (Telegram ~80% since 03/2026, Telegram calls off since 08/2025), with IP-CIDR for their media servers; (2) Meta/X/LinkedIn/Twitch/TikTok; (3) YouTube (blocked outright since 02/2026) + streaming services that left Russia; (4) blocked press; (5) VPN / privacy; (6) AI / dev / cloud; (7) foreign hosting & Cloudflare throttled at 16 KB (since 06/2025, still in force 07/2026); (8) public DNS. Lines marked "# unverified" have no independent 2026 source yet.
#!homepage=https://github.com/kulinh/gfw-vnm

# ============================================================================
#  HOW TO USE (blacklist mode, while in Russia)
#  1) Settings > Modules: add this module.
#  2) In your config (.conf) the LAST line of [Rule] must be:  FINAL,DIRECT
#     => the domains/IPs below go through PROXY, everything else (Yandex, VK, Sber,
#     Gosuslugi, Ozon...) goes direct. Important: Russian bank/government apps
#     reached through a VPN get flagged and can get the node's IP blocked (Xeovo 08/2026).
#  3) If mobile data falls into "white list" mode (only ~57+ Russian services
#     reachable, the 2025-2026 mobile shutdowns), NO rule can help: only fixed
#     Wi-Fi works, or wait for the shutdown to end.
#  4) cf-vpn panel: the RWL-RU config (.../sub/<token>/RWL-RU.conf or
#     &rules=ru) already inlines this module, no need to add it by hand.
#  Technical notes (ntc.party / habr 06/2026): TSPU freezes TLS connections to
#  foreign hosting IPs after ~16 KB (25 packets) and when >3 parallel handshakes go to
#  the same SNI; prefer VLESS-REALITY routes (valid SNI, uTLS firefox/random),
#  enable mux; HY2/QUIC is blocked outright on Tele2 and filtered on MegaFon/Beeline.
#  Sources (09/2026): itdoginfo/allow-domains (Russia/inside-raw),
#  express.ms messenger table 04/2026, zona.media 04/2026, Cloudflare blog
#  (updated 07/2026), ntc.party threads 16061/17013/20340/23843, MacRumors
#  (FaceTime 12/2025), The Record (Speedtest 07/2025, Roblox 12/2025), BGP
#  AS32934/AS62014.. reused from sr_proxy_list_UAE (09/2026); Cloudflare IPs from
#  cloudflare.com/ips-v4 (2026-09-13).
# ============================================================================

[Rule]

# ============================================================================
#  GROUP 1 — OTT MESSAGING / VOICE & VIDEO CALLS
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------- WhatsApp (blocked outright 11-12/02/2026) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.net,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,whatsapp.biz,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wa.me,PROXY

# ---------------------------- Facebook / Messenger / Instagram / Threads ---
#   Meta labelled "extremist" since 03/2022; Messenger & Instagram Direct blocked.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com,PROXY
