# ============================================================================
#  GROUP 6 — CLOUDFLARE & FOREIGN HOSTING (16 KB throttle: Rostelecom, MegaFon,
#  Vimpelcom, MTS, MGTS since 2025-06-09; Cloudflare confirmed still in force 07/2026;
#  ntc.party 04/2026: OVH/G-Core/CloudFront time out, "8.*" CF ranges whitelisted).
#  This IP-CIDR block sends EVERY site behind Cloudflare through the proxy (heavy, but
#  it matches the "page loads halfway then stalls" symptom). The proxy's own
#  traffic is not affected: rules never apply to the connection to the proxy itself.
#  Source: cloudflare.com/ips-v4 (2026-09-13).
# ============================================================================
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pages.dev,PROXY
